		{
			"id":"9ddeb42d20509bfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Info\n\nAmong the rooms we know that might have levers we have:\n- [[Greenhouse.canvas|Greenhouse]] (South Door)\n- [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]] (North Door - Leads to [[046 - Room 46.canvas|046 - Room 46]])\n- [[Secret Garden.canvas|Secret Garden]] (East and West Doors)\n- [[Weight Room.canvas|Weight Room]] - You can break the wall on the Weight Room to reveal the Antechamber South Lever.\n- [[Great Hall.canvas|Great Hall]] - Sometimes a lever spawns on this room, maybe sometimes it will need a [[Power Hammer.canvas|Power Hammer]] (Unconfirmed need) - East Lever",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-680,
			"y":-520,
			"width":500,
			"height":440
		}
